# Served publicly from the repo root, describes the internals, and goes stale.
# Keep it local: a Disallow rule would only advertise the path.
README.md

# Local dev helpers, not part of the site. anteprima-telefono.sh serves a copy
# of the TRACKED files only, on the LAN, so the phone sees what the domain would
# serve and not the working tree — which is the whole reason it exists and the
# reason it must not become part of the working tree it is checking.
avvia-sito.sh
anteprima-telefono.sh

# Internal strategy notes. Every file in the repo root is served from the public
# domain, so this must never be published.
GEO-STRATEGY.md

# Sources used to generate og-image.png and apple-touch-icon.png.
# Keep them locally; they must never be served from the public domain.
og-image.svg
touch-icon-src.svg

# Original logo exports from the designer
Copia di spinne software logo.svg
Copia di spinne software logo (1).svg

.DS_Store

# Python bytecode. tools/ IS served from the public domain — everything in the
# repo is — so a committed __pycache__ would publish compiled copies of the
# build scripts to spinnesoftware.com. The scripts themselves stay tracked:
# they are how the pages are generated and belong in the history.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Agent skills installed with `npx skills add` (Leonxlnx/taste-skill).
#
# They are tooling for whoever is editing the site, not part of the site. The
# same rule as __pycache__ above applies and is the reason this matters here
# more than in a normal repository: everything in this tree is served from
# spinnesoftware.com, so a committed .agents/ would publish thirteen skill
# documents — instructions written by a third party — at a public URL under
# the company's own domain.
#
# .claude/ holds symlinks INTO .agents/, so it is the same content by another
# path; skills-lock.json is the manifest that reproduces both. All three are
# recreated by re-running the install, and none of them is a decision worth
# keeping in the history.
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json

# Content audit notes. Same rule as GEO-STRATEGY.md: the repo root is served
# from the public domain, so internal notes must never be published.
CONTENT-AUDIT.md

# Scratch harnesses and probes. Everything in the repo root is served from
# spinnesoftware.com, so a debugging page left here is a debugging page on the
# public site — and check.sh rightly fails on it for having no canonical and no
# sitemap entry. The underscore prefix is the convention; keep using it.
_*.html
_*.js

# Riscrittura dei testi, settembre 2026: il documento di consegna, il registro di
# lavorazione e i due dump del testo pubblicato. Stessa regola di GEO-STRATEGY.md e
# CONTENT-AUDIT.md — la root è servita dal dominio pubblico, e questi quattro sono
# note interne. RISCRITTURA-TESTI.txt in particolare cita percorsi e numeri di riga
# del repo Sparkle, i piani tariffari non pubblicati, difetti aperti e un proxy che
# custodisce chiavi di fornitori: pubblicarlo sarebbe molto peggio che inutile.
RISCRITTURA-TESTI.txt
RISCRITTURA-PROGRESS.md
VOCE-PROGRESS.md
TESTI-PAGINE.md
TESTI-PAGINE-TUTTE-LE-LINGUE.txt
